      "content": "ALDBURY                     TROOPER ROAD SP 4612 (West Side) 12/33                                                       K6 Telephone Kiosk next to No. 14 GV                                                          II Telephone kiosk. Type K6. Designed 1935 by Sir Giles Gilbert Scott. Made by various contractors. Cast iron. Square kiosk with domed roof. Unperforated crowns to top panels and margin glazing to windows and door. Listing NGR: SP9647712401"
